 at 555 nm) to minimize eye fatigue during extended 12h+ shifts.
Starlight Amber (590 nm - Aviation Glass Cockpit):
Dark warm graphite (#0A0804) and warm aviation amber phosphor (#F59E0B) providing high contrast without harsh glare.
